            <ArticleTitle>Joint pains with psoriasis and long-term systemic etretinate therapy: a case report and summary of 12 cases.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>651-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of psoriasis with joint pain related to long-term etretinate therapy. In addition, our experiences with twelve additional patients with psoriasis who also received etretinate therapy are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
